(7366057, 1152355, 83149, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  I love the models'' pose in this.<br/> <br/>That being said, there is a dark halo around the males head that basically goes all the way to the woman''s hair.  I think the black shirt (I think?) and the dress hooked on the mans foot take away from the display of form.  The lighting is a little hot on the chest and neck on the right as well.<br/> <br/>Still a very good overall image, but I think IMHO it could have been great.  I really love these displays of the human form.<br/> <br/>I am guessing this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=112972" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AllenP</a>''s work.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  I love the models'' pose in this. That being said, there is a dark halo around the males head that basically goes all the way to the woman''s hair.  I think the black shirt (I think?) and the dress hooked on the mans foot take away from the display of form.  The lighting is a little hot on the chest and neck on the right as well. Still a very good overall image, but I think IMHO it could have been great.  I really love these displays of the human form. I am guessing this is  AllenP''s work.', '2015-06-17 21:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
