(7366888, 1152287, 115814, '<td valign="top">Interesting that the apparent lack of connection to the challenge impacted this terrific image the way it appears to have. I stopped on this image for longer than most, pondering what was the opposite. I eventually figured that it might be the direction of the flowing arcs of fabric, body, hair, that might be the opposites. Then I thought that perhaps it was the hair and fabric colors, then... implied "opposition" of a DNMC entry. Eventually I stopped caring and scored it high as a lovely well executed image, which is the opposite of my normal practice... Kudos!</td>', 'Interesting that the apparent lack of connection to the challenge impacted this terrific image the way it appears to have. I stopped on this image for longer than most, pondering what was the opposite. I eventually figured that it might be the direction of the flowing arcs of fabric, body, hair, that might be the opposites. Then I thought that perhaps it was the hair and fabric colors, then... implied "opposition" of a DNMC entry. Eventually I stopped caring and scored it high as a lovely well executed image, which is the opposite of my normal practice... Kudos!', '2015-06-19 03:05:27.000000', NULL, 0),
