(7370447, 1152735, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>I really feel that your entry took a hit from the DNMC people. It happens to everyone from time to time. That point aside, on to the actual image.<br/> <br/>The pic overall I don''t think is that bad. The smoke is vivid. It has a black and white feel to it but it is obviously a color pic. There is plenty of detail in the grill and smoke. This could work as an advertisement photo. I can almost taste the steak. Happy shooting. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hello from the critique club... I really feel that your entry took a hit from the DNMC people. It happens to everyone from time to time. That point aside, on to the actual image. The pic overall I don''t think is that bad. The smoke is vivid. It has a black and white feel to it but it is obviously a color pic. There is plenty of detail in the grill and smoke. This could work as an advertisement photo. I can almost taste the steak. Happy shooting.  ', '2015-06-23 13:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373761, 1152223, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>I''d like to say that is thinking outside the box. I love the idea of the rock paper scissors. It''s a very good idea for this challenge. Also the b&amp;w works very well. Everything seems to be very crisp and clear. There''s plenty of detail throughout. I also like the simplistic approach that you too. Well done. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... I''d like to say that is thinking outside the box. I love the idea of the rock paper scissors. It''s a very good idea for this challenge. Also the b&w works very well. Everything seems to be very crisp and clear. There''s plenty of detail throughout. I also like the simplistic approach that you too. Well done. Happy shooting', '2015-06-26 16:52:56.000000', NULL, 0),
